<title>FRANCE: Trading in Gle des Eaux shares postponed.</title>
<headline>Trading in Gle des Eaux shares postponed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Cie Generale des Eaux shares has been delayed until 1130 GMT, pending a statement from the company, the SBF French stockmarkets association said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
